##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## var a as i32 is 1
## calling a.cmp with 2    # -1
## ```
bind i32 with Ordered:
    weave cmp with other as i32 into int:
        var me as i32 is essence of self
        if me > other:
            return 1
        if me < other:
            return -1
        return 0

