## Implements `Ordered` for `f64` with the native comparison operators.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `other`: the f64 to compare against the receiver.
##
## ## Retorno
## `1` when the receiver is greater, `-1` when it is smaller, `0` when they are equal. Borrows both operands.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## var a as f64 is 1
## calling a.cmp with 2    # -1
## ```
bind f64 with Ordered:
