    ##
    ## ## Ejemplo
    ## ```pengu
    ## var out as map of string to float is calling m.map_values_scale with 2.0
    ## ```
    weave map_values_scale with factor as V into map of K to V:
        var out as map of K to V is map of K to V
        for k in essence of self:
            var v as V is self at k
            calling out.put with k, (v * factor)
        return out

    ## Largest value; `donum V` (zero) for an empty map.
    ##
    ## ## Parámetros
    ## - None: the receiver is the map to reduce.
    ##
    ## ## Retorno
    ## The maximum as `V`, or `donum V` when the map is empty. Borrows the receiver.
    ##
    ## ## Ejemplo
    ## ```pengu
    ## calling m.max_value    # 3
    ## ```
    weave max_value into V:
        var best as V is donum V
        var first_v as bool is true
        for k in essence of self:
            var v as V is self at k
            if first_v:
                set best is v
                set first_v is false
            else:
                if v > best:
                    set best is v
        return best

    ## Smallest value; `donum V` (zero) for an empty map.
    ##
    ## ## Parámetros
    ## - None: the receiver is the map to reduce.
    ##
    ## ## Retorno
    ## The minimum as `V`, or `donum V` when the map is empty. Borrows the receiver.
