    ## calling m.min_value    # 1
    ## ```
    weave min_value into V:
        var best as V is donum V
        var first_v as bool is true
        for k in essence of self:
            var v as V is self at k
            if first_v:
                set best is v
                set first_v is false
            else:
                if v < best:
                    set best is v
        return best

    ## `true` when every value lies inside `[lo, hi]`.
    ##
    ## ## Parámetros
    ## - `lo`: lower bound, inclusive.
    ## - `hi`: upper bound, inclusive.
    ##
    ## ## Retorno
