    ## ```
    weave values_in_range with lo as V, hi as V into bool:
        for k in essence of self:
            var v as V is self at k
            if v < lo:
                return false
            if v > hi:
                return false
        return true

    ## Submap with the values inside `[lo, hi]` inclusive.
    ##
    ## ## Parámetros
    ## - `lo`: lower bound, inclusive.
    ## - `hi`: upper bound, inclusive.
    ##
    ## ## Retorno
