enchanting map of shard K to bool shard K and V where K: Par, V: Par:
    ## Counts the entries whose value is `true`.
    ##
    ## ## Parámetros
    ## - None: the receiver is the `map of K to bool` to count.
    ##
    ## ## Retorno
